stions following this  announcement but now it's my pleasure to  introduce yells president Peter Salva  thank you very much Michael thank you  all for coming it's hard to believe it's  been a year since our last announcement  in this very location yell as you know  is honored to be the home of the wyndham  Campbell prizes and to the wyndham  Campbell prizes festival and we're  especially grateful to the late donald  windham and sandy campbell for creating  this legacy it's always humbling to  stand in the glow of this tower of books  one of the great monuments to human  intellectual achievement really one of  the great monuments to human  intellectual achievement in the world I  can't think of a more appropriate  setting to announce the winners of a  global literary prize than here at the  by two key I feel certain the winners  will one day add their inscriptions to  this monument as Michael noted all nine  Prize winners will come to yell in  September during last year's festival  the entire campus lit up with excitement  as we celebrated the work of our prize  winners with talks classes performances  readings film screenings and impromptu  conversations about these great writers  it was an inspiration to kick off my  first year as yells president amid such  a buzz it's my feeling that by  establishing the prizes at yell Donald  Donald Wyndham knew that he was placing  them in the care of a friend who shared  his concerns that writers be supported  and that their achievements not go  unrecognized so I look forward to  welcoming  all of this year's prize winners to Yale  in September and I hope their work will  continue to inspire readers on campus  and around the world there are eight  Prize winners this year three each of  the categories of drama and fiction and  two in nonfiction so the wyndham  campbell prizes for drama are awarded to  from the united states kia cars run  through her command of dramatic  spectacle kiya kar throng places often  unheard and margina